  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et ut monetarii pauciores sint quam antea fuerint: in omni summo portu III, et in omni alio portu sit unus monetarius.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And moneyers shall be fewer in number than they have been in the past. In every principal town [there shall be] three, and every other town [there shall be] one.</ab>
      </div>
